  "description": "ZEVFEP crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 4/n n c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C80 H136 O42 S8 Tb9 1-,C2 H8 N1 1+. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1A (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1B (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1C (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1D (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1E (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1F (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1G (Tb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 20 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.594-5.083 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.77-172.72°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [(CH3)2NH2][Tb9(TC4A)2(μ3-O)8(μ4-O)2(H2O)24]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 24 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
